# tela/src/web.fab — tela:web — the WebController annotation contract
# (English-first).
#
# SOURCE: faber-web/src/web.fab (la) converted to the English-first surface
# (web-to-tela-consumer-migration U1, web-mig-u1-tela-web-annotation;
# DELIVERY.md §U1). This is the browser-app packaging entry contract:
# faber product packaging discovers + verifies controller fns through the
# `WebController` annotation (controllers.rs `discover_controllers`). Only
# the annotation is carried here — `Mount`/`mount`/`selector_of` are
# superseded by the `tela:browser.mount` lifecycle (DELIVERY §4; no
# consumer uses them). The `@ annotatio { target = fn }` keyword surface is
# the en-probed form (`radix check --locale en`; `annotatio` is a hard
# parser keyword — not locale-mapped — `functio → fn` is the en mapping).
# Import-free (the G4-safe flat shape).
#
# Keyword surface (en): genus→class, textus→string, functio→fn.

@ public
@ annotatio { target = fn }
class WebController {
    string selector
}
